        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><code>checkbox</code> = <strong>True</strong>, <code>switch</code> = <strong>False</strong></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">They return the same thing \u2014 a <code>bool</code> \u2014 so the choice is purely about\ntone. A <strong>checkbox</strong> reads as \"tick this option\" in a list of settings; a\n<strong>switch</strong> reads as \"turn this feature on/off\". Pick whichever matches the\nmental model and stay consistent.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
