          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><code>text</code> = <strong>''</strong>, <code>text_area</code> has\n<strong>0</strong> characters, <code>code_editor</code> has\n<strong>1</strong> line(s).</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>text</strong> is a single line \u2014 names, search boxes, a URL; it also does\n<code>kind=\"password\"</code> and <code>\"email\"</code>. <strong>text_area</strong> is the multi-line version\nfor prompts or free-form notes. <strong>code_editor</strong> adds syntax highlighting,\nwhich is handy in teaching material when you want people to edit a snippet\nand feed it back into the notebook. Note text inputs debounce by default,\nso the value updates when you stop typing rather than on every keystroke.</span></span>"
