          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">uploaded: <strong>nothing yet</strong>, browsed: <strong>nothing yet</strong></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>file</strong> uploads a file's <em>contents</em> into the notebook \u2014 the value is a\nlist of results with <code>.name</code> and <code>.contents</code> (bytes). That's the one for a\ndeployed app where the user is on another machine. <strong>file_browser</strong> picks a\n<em>path</em> on the machine the notebook is running on, which is more useful for\nlocal work where the data is already on disk.</span></span>"
