            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">you selected <strong>0</strong> row(s).</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>table</strong> renders a list of dicts, a dataframe (pandas or polars) or a\ndict of columns, with search, sorting and paging built in. Set\n<code>selection=\"single\"</code> or <code>\"multi\"</code> and <code>.value</code> gives you back the chosen\nrows \u2014 a clean way to let someone pick records and drive the next cell off\nthem. For editing cells in place look at <code>mo.ui.data_editor</code>, and for a\nno-code column explorer there's <code>mo.ui.dataframe</code>.</span></span>"
