        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"layout-tabs\">Layout \u2014 <code>tabs</code></h2></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "pHFh",
      "code_hash": "7f3a2f5341da2ff274909c6e8b344cb0",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<marimo-ui-element object-id='pHFh-0' random-id='1c128427-63db-5906-70f3-f2fbe93dcaa1'><marimo-tabs data-initial-value='&quot;&quot;' data-label='null' data-tabs='[&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eOverview&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;,&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eDetails&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;,&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eNotes&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;]' data-orientation='&quot;horizontal&quot;'><div data-kind='tab'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Tabs organise content \u2014 the value is the open tab.</span></span></div><div data-kind='tab'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Put a heavy widget in a lazy tab to defer its work.</span></span></div><div data-kind='tab'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Handy for keeping a dense notebook navigable.</span></span></div></marimo-tabs></marimo-ui-element>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "NCOB",
      "code_hash": "07188551c3cb64e61a348b601e17c646",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">open tab: <strong>Overview</strong></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>tabs</strong> is layout rather than input, but it still reports which tab is\nopen via <code>.value</code>. Pair it with <code>mo.hstack</code>/<code>mo.vstack</code> and <code>mo.accordion</code>\nto keep a widget-heavy notebook from turning into one long scroll. Set\n<code>lazy=True</code> so a tab's contents only compute when it's first opened.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "aqbW",
      "code_hash": "6e4a3ef53089a4481cb6268f41a577d1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"where-to-go-next\">Where to go next</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">That covers the everyday widgets. A few specialised ones I've skipped\nbecause they need extra libraries or a real device: <code>mo.ui.altair_chart</code>,\n<code>mo.ui.plotly</code> and <code>mo.ui.matplotlib</code> make plots that report selections\nback as <code>.value</code>; <code>mo.ui.microphone</code> and <code>mo.ui.chat</code> are for audio and LLM\nchat; <code>mo.ui.anywidget</code> lets you drop in any\n<a href=\"https://anywidget.dev\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">anywidget</a>. The full list is in the\n<a href=\"https://docs.marimo.io/api/inputs/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">inputs reference</a>.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The pattern is always the same: build the widget in one cell, read\n<code>.value</code> in another, and let marimo work out what re-runs.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
